# Only what the application image needs: the app Rust workspace (the tiers, the entry points, and the two app
# crates X-5/W-1 added), the UI build script, the site's static files, the form templates. The wasm is built inside
# the image, so any local build of it is left out.
#
# `tests/` is NOT here: it is a workspace member whose manifest depends on the private Forge git repository, and
# the image's workspace drops that member before Cargo resolves anything. `forge/` is not here either — X-5 moved
# Forge to its own repository.
*
!Cargo.toml
!Cargo.lock
!web
!middle
!db
!cli
!re-host
!observability
target
!scripts/rust-ui-build.sh
!public
public/rust-ui
!middle/model/forms/templates
